  "_route": "read from the page rendered at 200 dpi, then VERIFIED BY ARITHMETIC rather than by the reader's confidence: panel.py re-derives every subtotal from its components and cross-checks the profit line against a DIFFERENT statement extracted independently by OCR. Nothing here is trusted because it was read; it is trusted because it foots and because two documents agree.",
